              "name": "v4",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "layout": "vertical",
              "gap": 16,
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "AUlJx",
                  "name": "v4ref",
                  "fill": "#C4994C",
                  "content": "โรม 12:1",
                  "fontFamily": "Inter",
                  "fontSize": 83,
                  "fontWeight": "600"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "5rF1X",
                  "name": "v4txt",
                  "fill": "#2C2420",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "\"จงถวายตัวของท่านแด่พระเจ้าเป็นเครื่องบูชาที่มีชีวิต บริสุทธิ์ และเป็นที่พอพระทัยพระเจ้า ซึ่งเป็นการนมัสการโดยวิญญาณของท่าน\"",
                  "lineHeight": 1.7,
                  "fontFamily": "Inter",
                  "fontSize": 83,
                  "fontWeight": "normal",
                  "fontStyle": "italic"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "8iCMt",
              "name": "v5",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "layout": "vertical",
              "gap": 16,
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "1jUbe",
                  "name": "v5ref",
                  "fill": "#C4994C",
                  "content": "สดุดี 150:6",
                  "fontFamily": "Inter",
                  "fontSize": 83,
                  "fontWeight": "600"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "XIPV0",
                  "name": "v5txt",
                  "fill": "#2C2420",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "\"ให้ทุกสิ่งที่มีลมหายใจสรรเสริญพระยาห์เวห์\nจงสรรเสริญพระยาห์เวห์เถิด\"",
                  "lineHeight": 1.7,
                  "fontFamily": "Inter",
                  "fontSize": 83,
                  "fontWeight": "normal",
                  "fontStyle": "italic"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
