              "layout": "vertical",
              "gap": 12,
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "907BZ",
                  "name": "q10a",
                  "fill": "#C4994C",
                  "content": "N. T. Wright (2006, Simply Christian)",
                  "fontFamily": "Inter",
                  "fontSize": 83,
                  "fontWeight": "600"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "aUgnU",
                  "name": "q10e",
                  "fill": "#6B5D52",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "\"Worship is the glad response of hearts that have been set free.\"",
                  "lineHeight": 1.5,
                  "fontFamily": "Inter",
                  "fontSize": 83,
                  "fontWeight": "normal",
                  "fontStyle": "italic"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "IyLev",
                  "name": "q10t",
                  "fill": "#2C2420",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "\"การนมัสการคือการตอบสนองด้วยความยินดีของหัวใจที่ได้รับการปลดปล่อย\"",
                  "lineHeight": 1.5,
                  "fontFamily": "Inter",
                  "fontSize": 83,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "28cf2",
              "name": "q11",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "layout": "vertical",
              "gap": 12,
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "lEked",
                  "name": "q11a",
                  "fill": "#C4994C",
                  "content": "Taya Smith (Hillsong United, c. 2015)",
                  "fontFamily": "Inter",
                  "fontSize": 83,
                  "fontWeight": "600"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "xpPx5",
                  "name": "q11e",
                  "fill": "#6B5D52",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "\"It's not about how it sounds, it's about the heart behind it.\"",
                  "lineHeight": 1.5,
                  "fontFamily": "Inter",
                  "fontSize": 83,
                  "fontWeight": "normal",
                  "fontStyle": "italic"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "EoPtb",
                  "name": "q11t",
                  "fill": "#2C2420",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "\"การนมัสการไม่สำคัญว่ามันเพราะแค่ไหน แต่คือหัวใจที่อยู่เบื้องหลัง\"",
                  "lineHeight": 1.5,
                  "fontFamily": "Inter",
                  "fontSize": 83,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "ktNle",
              "name": "q12",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "layout": "vertical",
              "gap": 12,
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "dx2FA",
                  "name": "q12a",
                  "fill": "#C4994C",
                  "content": "Matt Papa (2019, Look and Live)",
                  "fontFamily": "Inter",
                  "fontSize": 83,
                  "fontWeight": "600"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "FRfBs",
                  "name": "q12e",
                  "fill": "#6B5D52",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "\"Worship is seeing and savoring the glory of God.\"",
                  "lineHeight": 1.5,
                  "fontFamily": "Inter",
                  "fontSize": 83,
                  "fontWeight": "normal",
                  "fontStyle": "italic"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "QWNmg",
                  "name": "q12t",
                  "fill": "#2C2420",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "\"การนมัสการคือการมองเห็นและชื่นชมในพระสิริของพระเจ้า\"",
                  "lineHeight": 1.5,
                  "fontFamily": "Inter",
                  "fontSize": 83,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
